<title>USA: Primark Corp full-year net per share $1.38.</title>
<headline>Primark Corp full-year net per share $1.38.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>	  12   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.38		    $0.82</p>
<p> Net		 36,749		   16,882</p>
<p> Revs		767,125		  610,216</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  26,555		   20,602</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 results include one-time gain from sale of Primark Storage Leasing Corp. Excluding non-recurring items, net income per share in 1996 was $1.04, compared to $0.80 for 1995.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
